OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on #19m scheme to
OL,4,Aboost water quality
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun on a #19m project to
OL,7,Fimprove water quality in and around
OL,8,FBarnsley.
OL,10,FThe scheme will use specialist
OL,11,Fchemicals and "helpful bacteria" to
OL,12,Freduce the amount of phosphorus at
OL,13,FYorkshire Water's Wombwell wastewater
OL,14,Ftreatment site.
OL,16,FThe company said while phosphorous from
OL,17,Fproducts such as shampoo and washing
OL,18,Fmachine detergent is a normal part of
OL,19,Fdomestic wastewater, too much can be
OL,20,Fdamaging to humans and animals.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
